The 25th annual QuakeCon is a global Super Stream. Due to the global pandemic of Covid-19, the physical event could not take place, but instead, this iteration is digital festival (hence the name). Featuring 60 straight hours of nonstop live content from around the world, Quakeworld is again represented among many other titles. 

Seeing signups from many continents, this event could hold some rare sighted matchups between the best players on the planet.

