===Rules===
* 10 min duels with 3 min overtime
* All rounds are {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}}, except first two rounds in UB 
* Ruleset: smackdown
* Server Picks: Fairest pings rule all, defaulting to US-EAST for NA vs EU matchups.
* {{abbr|BO1|Best of 1}}: High seed tosses first, then low seed. Low seed tosses, High seed picks. 
* {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}}: High seed picks, low seed picks. For tiebreakers, toss from remaining maps, low seed first, then high seed.

